          "style": "checkbox",
          "frame": "dashed",
          "ink": "orange"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "bash",
          "lines": [
            "git config alias.pushsafe \\",
            "  \"push --force-with-lease \\",
            "  --force-if-includes\""
          ],
          "note": "alias makes the safe form default"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "☆ 7. Why Pushes Get Rejected",
          "ink": "red"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Rebased commits get **new SHAs**, so your copy diverges",
            "A normal push is rejected as non-fast-forward",
            "Plain `--force` can erase a teammate's commits",
            "==--force-with-lease== checks the remote still matches your fetch"
          ],
          "style": "cross",
          "frame": "dashed",
          "ink": "red"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "bash",
          "lines": [
            "git push",
            "# ! [rejected] (non-fast-forward)",
            "git push --force-with-lease",
            "# stale info if remote moved"
          ],
          "note": "lease refuses when remote moved"
        }
      ],
      "hero": "git",
      "subtitle": "Rewrite without regret"
