          "note": "backup is just a free pointer"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Back up first: `git branch backup-feature` before risky rebases",
            "Use ==--autostash== to reapply uncommitted changes around a rebase",
            "Prefer `git pull --rebase` locally: no noisy merge commits",
            "Run tests after every rebase, even a clean one"
          ],
          "style": "checkbox",
          "frame": "dashed",
          "ink": "green"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "4. Rebase or Merge?",
